<p>Halchal hai fouje shaam me Abbas aate hai,<br>
Dariya ka ruq hai mushko alam saath laate hai.</p>

<p>Ghamsaan ki ladai hai sahil pe sher se,<br>
Naami jo pehelwan hai tharraye jate hai.</p>

<p>Sar peet kar yeh shimr pukara ghazab hua,<br>
Jo fouj ke salaar hai sab maare jate hai.</p>

<p>Dekho toh is jalal ki kuch inteha bhi hai,<br>
Gaisu ghazab se dosh pe bal khaye jate hai.</p>

<p>Badh kar jari ka gaiz yeh kehta hai fouj se,<br>
Hat jao pani lene ko Abbas aate hai.</p>

<p>Jab tak thi jang fouj se ghusse ki hadh na thi,<br>
Dariya me ghoda dal ke ab muskarate hai.</p>

<p>Chullu me pani lene ka shayed sabab yeh tha,<br>
Nehre furaat qabze me apne batate hai.</p>

<p>Alqissa bhar li mashke Sakina bhi neher se,<br>
Dariya pe pyase aaye the pyase hi jaate hai...</p>